WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
NOMURA-RT: Following up on the ten year bid, we are still good for size all afternoon.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Marcus: Good timing, I just finished checking two other lines for reference on that level.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
NOMURA-RT: And what did you find?

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Marcus: Both lines confirmed the move is real, driven by the supra issuance calendar you mentioned.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
NOMURA-RT: Good, so the level checks out on your side too.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Marcus: It does. I have signed off with the desk head, we can trade a portion here.

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
NOMURA-RT: Same terms as before, one point four eight two bid on the first clip?

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Marcus: Same terms, we will take two hundred to start and reassess after that.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
NOMURA-RT: Understood, confirming two hundred at one point four eight two on our side.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Marcus: Confirmed. Appreciate you holding the level while we did our diligence.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
NOMURA-RT: No problem, that is exactly how it should work with an anomaly like this.

12
00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Marcus: Agreed. If the remaining client interest is still there later today, keep us posted.

13
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:20.000
NOMURA-RT: Will do, there is more behind it if today goes smoothly.

14
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Marcus: Sounds good, we would be interested in seeing the rest depending on how the book looks.

15
00:04:40.000 --> 00:05:00.000
NOMURA-RT: Understood, I will circle back this afternoon.

16
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:20.000
Marcus: Thanks again, talk soon.
